---
title: "ST-02 Pull Request Lifecycle (UML State Machine Diagram)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Open: opened
  state Open {
    [*] --> checking
    checking --> clean: merge-tree ok
    checking --> conflict: merge-tree conflicts
    clean --> checking: head or base pushed
    conflict --> checking: head or base pushed
  }
  Open --> Merged: merge [clean, checks green, CAS ok]
  Open --> Closed: close
  Closed --> Open: reopen
  Merged --> [*]
